{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10114100","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10114100","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1011410001:1":{"text":"デリスカ、私たちはイミル様に会いに来たの。","source_cn":"德里斯加，我们求见伊米尔贤者。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD3B2D7083622364","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1011410002:1":{"text":"パリーサ……？なぜここに？","source_cn":"帕瑞莎……？你怎么回来了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9651BD28C9CA463","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1011410003:1":{"text":"いや、隊長の任を解かれた君に、メインベースへ入る資格はない！","source_cn":"不对，你已经不再是队长，无权进入荆棘营地！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93297254C226D44B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1011410004:1":{"text":"お願い、そこをどいて。","source_cn":"请让开，别阻拦我们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF35F3D7781212868","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1011410005:1":{"text":"……みんな、君は外の奴らと結託したと言っていたが、俺は信じなかった。だが、どうやら本当だったようだな。","source_cn":"……他们都说你勾结外人，我还不相信。如今亲眼所见，果然...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2E1360603FA4005","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1011410006:0":{"text":"ヴィジランツと風語りの奴らを連れて、駐屯地に押し入って何をする気だ！？君を見込んでくれたイミル様の命令に背くのか！？","source_cn":"你带着薄暮和风语的人，闯进营地是想做什么？当初是伊米尔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FE27B21774647D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1011410007:1":{"text":"デリスカ、護衛隊の使命は森を守ることであり、賢者様を擁護することじゃないわ。","source_cn":"德里斯加，荆棘卫队的使命是保护丛林，而非一昧拥护贤者。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26C2B61F0CFDE618","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1011410008:0":{"text":"今の茨に、森の護衛を名乗る資格があると思う？","source_cn":"现在的荆棘，还称得上是丛林的护卫吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8D5E18B1956563C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1011410009:0":{"text":"裏切り者は君の方だろう！","source_cn":"——真正的叛徒明明是你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CA0351249B6D3FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1011410010:0":{"text":"衛兵たち、列を成せ！あいつらを追い出すんだ！","source_cn":"卫士们，列队！把他们赶出去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x198CA9A54ECF1E33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:帕瑞莎":{"text":"パリーサ","source":"帕瑞莎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speak